{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c2e1a002-6859-4ae5-a54d-70c8c7190452",
    "name": "ventatalk-rescate — Albergues (admin + api)",
    "description": "Suite de pruebas para /api/albergues/* y /admin/albergues/*. Cubre auth publica, x-api-key y sesion web humana (con soporte dual reciente en los 4 endpoints admin de solicitudes/centros).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth - Sesion web (humano)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. GET Login page (captura csrf_login)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Trae el formulario de login y extrae el csrf_token embebido en el input hidden, necesario para el POST siguiente."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const m = pm.response.text().match(/name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"([^\"]+)\"/);",
                  "if (m) { pm.collectionVariables.set('csrf_login', m[1]); }",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. POST Login (crea cookie de sesion)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                "type": "text",
                "disabled": false
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login humano. admin_user/admin_pass deben apuntar a un ADMIN_1_USER/ADMIN_1_PASS valido de tu .env. La cookie de sesion queda guardada en el cookie jar de Postman para las siguientes requests del mismo dominio.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_pass}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "csrf_token",
                  "value": "{{csrf_login}}",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login redirige (303) o entra (200)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 303]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "// Postman guarda la cookie rescate_session automaticamente en su cookie jar."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. GET Dashboard (captura csrf_admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/dashboard",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "dashboard"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requiere haber corrido el login antes (usa la cookie de sesion). Extrae el csrf-token que el server embebe en <meta name=\"csrf-token\"> para usarlo en los POST/DELETE que se autentican por sesion."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const m = pm.response.text().match(/name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"([^\"]+)\"/);",
                  "if (m) { pm.collectionVariables.set('csrf_admin', m[1]); }",
                  "pm.test('200 OK (sesion activa)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. GET Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cierra la sesion (borra la cookie rescate_session)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Flujo de login humano sin tocar: sesion + cookie + CSRF. Corre estas 4 en orden antes de probar el bloque 'sesion' de los endpoints admin."
    },
